title:: BMSnapShotSeqConfigGUI
summary:: Documentation BEASTmulch - a GUI to select controllers for a snapshot seq
categories:: Classes

Description::

BMSnapShotSeqConfigGUI provides a modal sheet to select controls for a new snapshot sequence. Normally you would not create one directly, but it is used by BMControllerAutomatorGUI.

See also: link::Classes/Automation/BMSnapShot::, link::Classes/Automation/BMControllerAutomatorGUI::, link::Classes/Automation/BMControllerAutomator::

CLASSMETHODS::

method:: new

argument:: parent
The parent window. Usually this would be the window of a BMControllerAutomatorGUI.


Examples::
code::
(
c = BMVirtualController(\foo); // make some controls to select
BMSnapShotSeqConfigGUI(SCWindow("Fake").front).onClose_(_.postln);
)

c.free;
::